window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b259-5e5e1f41521ecaf3.json"]={sha256:"5e5e1f41521ecaf3018aade694cef236c4edd7f243f0bbe51a1b685f19330620",value:{"id":"b259","title":"壓力鋼管錨定與支承","titleEn":"Penstock anchorage and supports","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課用完整荷載路徑理解壓力鋼管，而不只套一條薄壁應力公式。十個單元依序分辨環向與軸向力、彎管向量、熱伸縮、滿管重量、跨距反力、滑動摩擦、錨塊基底及減薄檢查，要求每個簡化模型先畫自由體與邊界，再說明未包含的局部殼體、基礎與疲勞問題。","summaryEn":"This course follows the complete penstock load path rather than relying on one thin-wall formula. Ten units distinguish hoop and axial action, elbow vectors, thermal movement, full-pipe weight, span reactions, friction, anchor bearing and wall loss. Each simplified model begins with a free body and boundaries and identifies excluded shell, foundation and fatigue behavior.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-hydraulics","subcategoryTitle":"壩工監測、溢洪與壓力水路","subcategoryTitleEn":"Dam monitoring, spillways and pressure waterways","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-hydraulics","learningTags":["water","water-hydraulics","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-hydraulic","architectureNodes":[["環向薄膜應力","Circumferential membrane stress"],["彎管壓力向量","Elbow pressure vectors"],["完全約束熱應力","Fully restrained thermal stress"],["滑動摩擦與固定點","Sliding friction and fixed points"],["減薄與剩餘厚度","Wall loss and remaining thickness"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-hydraulic","labels":["環向薄膜應力","彎管壓力向量","完全約束熱應力","滑動摩擦與固定點","減薄與剩餘厚度"],"labelsEn":["Circumferential membrane stress","Elbow pressure vectors","Fully restrained thermal stress","Sliding friction and fixed points","Wall loss and remaining thickness"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創壓力敏感度：薄壁圓管內徑2m、均勻厚度0.020m，表壓2MPa時環向膜應力為100MPa。如果保持幾何及線彈性假設而壓力增加10%至2.2MPa，應力增為110MPa，增加10%。此線性關係不能證明材料、焊縫或支座仍有足夠餘量。學徒應再列端部軸力、彎管壓力向量和錨塊需求如何同時增加，並檢查壓力峰值是否出自水錘。若發生減薄、塑性或外壓屈曲，原先模型邊界已改變，不能以這個單一百分比概括所有失效機制。","textEn":"Original pressure sensitivity: a thin circular pipe with inner diameter2m and uniform thickness0.020m has hoop membrane stress100MPa at gauge pressure2MPa. Holding geometry and linear-elastic assumptions fixed while increasing pressure10% to2.2MPa raises stress to110MPa, also10%. That proportionality does not demonstrate adequate material, weld or support margin. Apprentices should also trace increased end force, elbow pressure vectors and anchor demands and determine whether the peak is a water-hammer transient. Wall loss, plasticity or external-pressure buckling changes the original model boundary, so one percentage cannot summarize every failure mechanism.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b259-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「環向薄膜應力」與「封閉端軸向作用」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Circumferential membrane stress\" and \"Closed-end axial action\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b259-v15-01","title":"環向薄膜應力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Circumferential membrane stress: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「環向薄膜應力」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Circumferential membrane stress” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"圓管內壓使管壁承受環向拉力，薄壁公式可先估量級，但只描述遠離支承與接頭的膜應力。焊接缺陷、橢圓化和局部加勁會改變應力分布，外壓失穩又是另一機制；必須先辨明幾何與壓力方向，不能把一個平均值當成整根鋼管安全證明。 假設薄壁圓管表壓p=2MPa、內徑D=2m、均勻壁厚t=0.020m，σh=pD/(2t)=100MPa；未含局部彎曲。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「環向薄膜應力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Internal pressure creates circumferential tension, and a thin-wall estimate gives membrane stress away from supports and connections. Weld defects, ovality and local stiffening alter the distribution, while external-pressure buckling is a different mechanism. Establish geometry and pressure direction before treating a mean stress as evidence about the entire penstock’s structural behavior. Assume thin circular pipe gauge pressure2MPa, inner diameter2m and uniform thickness0.020m. Hoopσh=pD/(2t)=100MPa, excluding local bending. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Circumferential membrane stress” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「環向薄膜應力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Circumferential membrane stress”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-01-k1","title":"環向薄膜應力","titleEn":"Circumferential membrane stress","text":"圓管內壓使管壁承受環向拉力，薄壁公式可先估量級，但只描述遠離支承與接頭的膜應力。焊接缺陷、橢圓化和局部加勁會改變應力分布，外壓失穩又是另一機制；必須先辨明幾何與壓力方向，不能把一個平均值當成整根鋼管安全證明。","textEn":"Internal pressure creates circumferential tension, and a thin-wall estimate gives membrane stress away from supports and connections. Weld defects, ovality and local stiffening alter the distribution, while external-pressure buckling is a different mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「環向薄膜應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Circumferential membrane stress\" is correct?","options":["平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。","圓管內壓使管壁承受環向拉力，薄壁公式可先估量級，但只描述遠離支承與接頭的膜應力。","封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。"],"optionsEn":["A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable.","Internal pressure creates circumferential tension, and a thin-wall estimate gives membrane stress away from supports and connections.","The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline."],"answer":1,"explanation":"圓管內壓使管壁承受環向拉力，薄壁公式可先估量級，但只描述遠離支承與接頭的膜應力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Internal pressure creates circumferential tension, and a thin-wall estimate gives membrane stress away from supports and connections. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b259-v15-02","title":"環向薄膜應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Circumferential membrane stress: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「環向薄膜應力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Circumferential membrane stress” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設薄壁圓管表壓p=2MPa、內徑D=2m、均勻壁厚t=0.020m，σh=pD/(2t)=100MPa；未含局部彎曲。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume thin circular pipe gauge pressure2MPa, inner diameter2m and uniform thickness0.020m. Hoopσh=pD/(2t)=100MPa, excluding local bending. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設薄壁圓管表壓p=2MPa、內徑D=2m、均勻壁厚t=0.020m，σh=pD/(2t)=100MPa；未含局部彎曲。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume thin circular pipe gauge pressure2MPa, inner diameter2m and uniform thickness0.020m. Hoopσh=pD/(2t)=100MPa, excluding local bending.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「環向薄膜應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Circumferential membrane stress\", which statement holds?","options":["算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。","管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks.","Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b259-v15-03","title":"環向薄膜應力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Circumferential membrane stress: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「環向薄膜應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Circumferential membrane stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。將支座、分岔、焊縫與變厚位置另列局部分析範圍，保留材料和厚度量測資料而不只比較單一應力數字。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio. Flag supports, branches, welds and thickness transitions for local analysis and retain material and measurement evidence rather than comparing only one stress value. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。將支座、分岔、焊縫與變厚位置另列局部分析範圍，保留材料和厚度量測資料而不只比較單一應力數字。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio. Flag supports, branches, welds and thickness transitions for local analysis and retain material and measurement evidence rather than comparing only one stress value.","failure":"注意干擾：局部腐蝕孔與焊縫缺陷可能控制承載，平均厚度會掩蓋最弱位置。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Local pits and weld flaws may govern strength while mean thickness hides the weakest region. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。將支座、分岔、焊縫與變厚位置另列局部分析範圍，保留材料和厚度量測資料而不只比較單一應力數字。","textEn":"Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio. Flag supports, branches, welds and thickness transitions for local analysis and retain material and measurement evidence rather than comparing only one stress value.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。將支座、分岔、焊縫與變厚位置另列局部分析範圍，保留材料和厚度量測資料而不只比較單一應力數字。","textEn":"Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio. Flag supports, branches, welds and thickness transitions for local analysis and retain material and measurement evidence rather than comparing only one stress value.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「環向薄膜應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Circumferential membrane stress\"?","options":["畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。"],"optionsEn":["Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫半圓自由體平衡，核對內徑、有效厚度及表壓使用方式，並計算厚徑比。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw a half-cylinder equilibrium diagram, checking inner diameter, effective thickness and gauge pressure and calculating thickness ratio. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b259-v15-04","title":"環向薄膜應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Circumferential membrane stress: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「環向薄膜應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Circumferential membrane stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"局部腐蝕孔與焊縫缺陷可能控制承載，平均厚度會掩蓋最弱位置。空管外部地下水形成的壓力方向相反，不能把內壓拉力公式直接用來證明抗屈曲能力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Local pits and weld flaws may govern strength while mean thickness hides the weakest region. Groundwater acting on a drained pipe reverses pressure direction, so an internal-tension formula does not establish external-buckling resistance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設薄壁圓管表壓p=2MPa、內徑D=2m、均勻壁厚t=0.020m，σh=pD/(2t)=100MPa；未含局部彎曲。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Hoopσh=pD/(2t)=100MPa, excluding local bending.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"局部腐蝕孔與焊縫缺陷可能控制承載，平均厚度會掩蓋最弱位置。空管外部地下水形成的壓力方向相反，不能把內壓拉力公式直接用來證明抗屈曲能力。","textEn":"Local pits and weld flaws may govern strength while mean thickness hides the weakest region. Groundwater acting on a drained pipe reverses pressure direction, so an internal-tension formula does not establish external-buckling resistance.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「環向薄膜應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Circumferential membrane stress\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","局部腐蝕孔與焊縫缺陷可能控制承載，平均厚度會掩蓋最弱位置。","封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Local pits and weld flaws may govern strength while mean thickness hides the weakest region.","The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline."],"answer":1,"explanation":"局部腐蝕孔與焊縫缺陷可能控制承載，平均厚度會掩蓋最弱位置。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Local pits and weld flaws may govern strength while mean thickness hides the weakest region. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b259-v15-05","title":"封閉端軸向作用：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Closed-end axial action: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「封閉端軸向作用」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Closed-end axial action” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"封閉端的壓力合力需要由管壁或其他結構路徑平衡，軸向應力取決於端部約束與伸縮接頭。對可自由伸長的封閉薄壁管可以直接用端面平衡，但固定管線、泊松變形和錨塊分擔會改變答案；不能將教學圓筒公式無條件貼到埋設管。 假設封閉端且軸向無外部約束，p=2MPa、D=2m、t=0.020m，σa=pD/(4t)=50MPa；固定管段需另建約束模型。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「封閉端軸向作用」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pressure on a closed end must be balanced through the wall or another structural path. Axial stress depends on end restraint and expansion joints. End equilibrium applies directly to a freely extending closed thin cylinder, but fixed pipelines, Poisson effects and anchor load sharing change that answer and require a consistent boundary model. Assume closed ends and no external axial restraint, withp=2MPa,D=2m,t=0.020m. Axialσa=pD/(4t)=50MPa; restrained segments require another model. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Closed-end axial action” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「封閉端軸向作用」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Closed-end axial action”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-05-k1","title":"封閉端軸向作用","titleEn":"Closed-end axial action","text":"封閉端的壓力合力需要由管壁或其他結構路徑平衡，軸向應力取決於端部約束與伸縮接頭。對可自由伸長的封閉薄壁管可以直接用端面平衡，但固定管線、泊松變形和錨塊分擔會改變答案；不能將教學圓筒公式無條件貼到埋設管。","textEn":"Pressure on a closed end must be balanced through the wall or another structural path. Axial stress depends on end restraint and expansion joints.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「封閉端軸向作用」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Closed-end axial action\" is correct?","options":["封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。","彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。","封閉端的壓力合力需要由管壁或其他結構路徑平衡，軸向應力取決於端部約束與伸縮接頭。"],"optionsEn":["The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline.","Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.","Pressure on a closed end must be balanced through the wall or another structural path."],"answer":2,"explanation":"封閉端的壓力合力需要由管壁或其他結構路徑平衡，軸向應力取決於端部約束與伸縮接頭。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pressure on a closed end must be balanced through the wall or another structural path. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b259-v15-06","title":"封閉端軸向作用：定量估算","titleEn":"Closed-end axial action: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「封閉端軸向作用」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Closed-end axial action” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設封閉端且軸向無外部約束，p=2MPa、D=2m、t=0.020m，σa=pD/(4t)=50MPa；固定管段需另建約束模型。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume closed ends and no external axial restraint, withp=2MPa,D=2m,t=0.020m. Axialσa=pD/(4t)=50MPa; restrained segments require another model. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設封閉端且軸向無外部約束，p=2MPa、D=2m、t=0.020m，σa=pD/(4t)=50MPa；固定管段需另建約束模型。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume closed ends and no external axial restraint, withp=2MPa,D=2m,t=0.020m. Axialσa=pD/(4t)=50MPa; restrained segments require another model.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「封閉端軸向作用」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Closed-end axial action\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。","梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation.","A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b259-v15-07","title":"封閉端軸向作用：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Closed-end axial action: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「封閉端軸向作用」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Closed-end axial action” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。分開列自由伸長與完全固定的邊界情境，核對管壁軸力與外部反力是否共同滿足整體平衡。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions. Separate free-extension and fixed-boundary cases, checking that wall force and external reactions together satisfy equilibrium of the complete selected pipe segment. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。分開列自由伸長與完全固定的邊界情境，核對管壁軸力與外部反力是否共同滿足整體平衡。","observationEn":"Site practice: Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions. Separate free-extension and fixed-boundary cases, checking that wall force and external reactions together satisfy equilibrium of the complete selected pipe segment.","failure":"注意干擾：若壓力推力已被錨塊承擔又完整加到管壁，會重複荷載；反之兩邊都忽略則遺失力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Assigning full pressure thrust to both wall and anchor double-counts load, while assigning it to neither loses equilibrium. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。分開列自由伸長與完全固定的邊界情境，核對管壁軸力與外部反力是否共同滿足整體平衡。","textEn":"Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions. Separate free-extension and fixed-boundary cases, checking that wall force and external reactions together satisfy equilibrium of the complete selected pipe segment.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。分開列自由伸長與完全固定的邊界情境，核對管壁軸力與外部反力是否共同滿足整體平衡。","textEn":"Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions. Separate free-extension and fixed-boundary cases, checking that wall force and external reactions together satisfy equilibrium of the complete selected pipe segment.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「封閉端軸向作用」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Closed-end axial action\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。","基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions.","Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沿管線標出固定點、滑動點與伸縮接頭，畫端部壓力進入管壁或錨塊的路徑。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map fixed points, sliding supports and expansion joints and trace end pressure into wall or anchor reactions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b259-v15-08","title":"封閉端軸向作用：失效診斷","titleEn":"Closed-end axial action: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「封閉端軸向作用」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Closed-end axial action” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若壓力推力已被錨塊承擔又完整加到管壁，會重複荷載；反之兩邊都忽略則遺失力。約束不清時即使公式算得精準，軸向設計仍可能根本錯位。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Assigning full pressure thrust to both wall and anchor double-counts load, while assigning it to neither loses equilibrium. Precise arithmetic cannot repair an axial design based on an undefined or inconsistent restraint condition. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設封閉端且軸向無外部約束，p=2MPa、D=2m、t=0.020m，σa=pD/(4t)=50MPa；固定管段需另建約束模型。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Axialσa=pD/(4t)=50MPa; restrained segments require another model.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若壓力推力已被錨塊承擔又完整加到管壁，會重複荷載；反之兩邊都忽略則遺失力。約束不清時即使公式算得精準，軸向設計仍可能根本錯位。","textEn":"Assigning full pressure thrust to both wall and anchor double-counts load, while assigning it to neither loses equilibrium. Precise arithmetic cannot repair an axial design based on an undefined or inconsistent restraint condition.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「封閉端軸向作用」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Closed-end axial action\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。","若壓力推力已被錨塊承擔又完整加到管壁，會重複荷載；反之兩邊都忽略則遺失力。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.","Assigning full pressure thrust to both wall and anchor double-counts load, while assigning it to neither loses equilibrium."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若壓力推力已被錨塊承擔又完整加到管壁，會重複荷載；反之兩邊都忽略則遺失力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Assigning full pressure thrust to both wall and anchor double-counts load, while assigning it to neither loses equilibrium. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b259-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「彎管壓力向量」與「自由熱伸長」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Elbow pressure vectors\" and \"Free thermal expansion\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b259-v15-09","title":"彎管壓力向量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Elbow pressure vectors: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「彎管壓力向量」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Elbow pressure vectors” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"管線轉向時兩端壓力力的向量差形成彎管合力，不能只把壓力乘單一截面就當成所有方向的錨定荷載。動量變化、水重、管重與支承反力還要在完整自由體另列；等壓靜態示例只幫助確認角度與方向，不代表實際組合荷載。 假設等徑2m、兩端表壓2MPa、轉角90°且忽略動量及重量，F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN，方向沿兩壓力向量合成。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「彎管壓力向量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A change in direction produces a resultant from the pressure-force vectors at an elbow’s ends. Pressure times one area alone does not describe every anchorage component. Momentum flux, water and pipe weight and support reactions belong in the full free body; an equal-pressure static example checks orientation rather than replacing the actual load combination. Assume diameter2m, equal gauge pressure2MPa and90° turn, neglecting momentum and weight. F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN along the pressure-vector resultant. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Elbow pressure vectors” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「彎管壓力向量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Elbow pressure vectors”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-09-k1","title":"彎管壓力向量","titleEn":"Elbow pressure vectors","text":"管線轉向時兩端壓力力的向量差形成彎管合力，不能只把壓力乘單一截面就當成所有方向的錨定荷載。動量變化、水重、管重與支承反力還要在完整自由體另列；等壓靜態示例只幫助確認角度與方向，不代表實際組合荷載。","textEn":"A change in direction produces a resultant from the pressure-force vectors at an elbow’s ends. Pressure times one area alone does not describe every anchorage component.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「彎管壓力向量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Elbow pressure vectors\" is correct?","options":["管線轉向時兩端壓力力的向量差形成彎管合力，不能只把壓力乘單一截面就當成所有方向的錨定荷載。","彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。","算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。"],"optionsEn":["A change in direction produces a resultant from the pressure-force vectors at an elbow’s ends.","Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.","Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks."],"answer":0,"explanation":"管線轉向時兩端壓力力的向量差形成彎管合力，不能只把壓力乘單一截面就當成所有方向的錨定荷載。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A change in direction produces a resultant from the pressure-force vectors at an elbow’s ends. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b259-v15-10","title":"彎管壓力向量：定量估算","titleEn":"Elbow pressure vectors: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「彎管壓力向量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Elbow pressure vectors” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設等徑2m、兩端表壓2MPa、轉角90°且忽略動量及重量，F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN，方向沿兩壓力向量合成。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume diameter2m, equal gauge pressure2MPa and90° turn, neglecting momentum and weight. F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN along the pressure-vector resultant. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設等徑2m、兩端表壓2MPa、轉角90°且忽略動量及重量，F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN，方向沿兩壓力向量合成。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume diameter2m, equal gauge pressure2MPa and90° turn, neglecting momentum and weight. F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN along the pressure-vector resultant.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「彎管壓力向量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Elbow pressure vectors\", which statement holds?","options":["管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。"],"optionsEn":["Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b259-v15-11","title":"彎管壓力向量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Elbow pressure vectors: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「彎管壓力向量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Elbow pressure vectors” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。再加入流速動量、重力與管壁傳力，標註哪些項已由相鄰固定點吸收，避免重複或漏列。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle. Then add momentum, gravity and wall-force paths, marking loads transferred to adjacent fixed points to prevent omission or double counting. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。再加入流速動量、重力與管壁傳力，標註哪些項已由相鄰固定點吸收，避免重複或漏列。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle. Then add momentum, gravity and wall-force paths, marking loads transferred to adjacent fixed points to prevent omission or double counting.","failure":"注意干擾：把九十度誤認為兩箭頭之夾角可能改變符號，錯把單端推力當合力則低估需求。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Confusing pipe turn with arrow orientation can reverse signs, and using one end thrust understates the resultant. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。再加入流速動量、重力與管壁傳力，標註哪些項已由相鄰固定點吸收，避免重複或漏列。","textEn":"Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle. Then add momentum, gravity and wall-force paths, marking loads transferred to adjacent fixed points to prevent omission or double counting.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。再加入流速動量、重力與管壁傳力，標註哪些項已由相鄰固定點吸收，避免重複或漏列。","textEn":"Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle. Then add momentum, gravity and wall-force paths, marking loads transferred to adjacent fixed points to prevent omission or double counting.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「彎管壓力向量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Elbow pressure vectors\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。","在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects.","Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在平面圖畫兩端法向及壓力箭頭，用分量法和向量模長各算一次，確認轉角定義。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw end normals and pressure arrows, calculating both components and resultant magnitude with a stated turn angle. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b259-v15-12","title":"彎管壓力向量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Elbow pressure vectors: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「彎管壓力向量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Elbow pressure vectors” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把九十度誤認為兩箭頭之夾角可能改變符號，錯把單端推力當合力則低估需求。真實彎管若有不同管徑或壓力，等壓等面積捷徑便不再成立。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Confusing pipe turn with arrow orientation can reverse signs, and using one end thrust understates the resultant. Unequal diameters or pressures invalidate the equal-area, equal-pressure shortcut even if the elbow angle is unchanged. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設等徑2m、兩端表壓2MPa、轉角90°且忽略動量及重量，F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN，方向沿兩壓力向量合成。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: F=2pA sin45°=8.8858MN along the pressure-vector resultant.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把九十度誤認為兩箭頭之夾角可能改變符號，錯把單端推力當合力則低估需求。真實彎管若有不同管徑或壓力，等壓等面積捷徑便不再成立。","textEn":"Confusing pipe turn with arrow orientation can reverse signs, and using one end thrust understates the resultant. Unequal diameters or pressures invalidate the equal-area, equal-pressure shortcut even if the elbow angle is unchanged.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「彎管壓力向量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Elbow pressure vectors\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把九十度誤認為兩箭頭之夾角可能改變符號，錯把單端推力當合力則低估需求。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。"],"optionsEn":["Confusing pipe turn with arrow orientation can reverse signs, and using one end thrust understates the resultant.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把九十度誤認為兩箭頭之夾角可能改變符號，錯把單端推力當合力則低估需求。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Confusing pipe turn with arrow orientation can reverse signs, and using one end thrust understates the resultant. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b259-v15-13","title":"自由熱伸長：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Free thermal expansion: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「自由熱伸長」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Free thermal expansion” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"暴露鋼管溫度改變會產生自由伸縮，支座與接頭必須提供與模型一致的運動空間。水溫、日照及安裝時溫度不必相同，沿線不均勻加熱還會造成彎曲；先算無約束伸長有助於辨認需求，但不能把這個位移視為固定管段也會自由發生。 假設均勻升溫30°C、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C、自由長度100m，ΔL=αLΔT=0.036m；未含溫度梯度與約束。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「自由熱伸長」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Exposed steel changes length with temperature, so supports and joints must permit the motion assumed by the model. Water temperature, solar heating and erection temperature differ, and nonuniform heating can induce bending. Computing unconstrained extension identifies movement demand without implying that a fixed segment can actually undergo the same free displacement. Assume uniform warming30°C, expansion coefficient12×10⁻⁶/°C and free length100m. ΔL=0.036m, excluding temperature gradients and restraint. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Free thermal expansion” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「自由熱伸長」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Free thermal expansion”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-13-k1","title":"自由熱伸長","titleEn":"Free thermal expansion","text":"暴露鋼管溫度改變會產生自由伸縮，支座與接頭必須提供與模型一致的運動空間。水溫、日照及安裝時溫度不必相同，沿線不均勻加熱還會造成彎曲；先算無約束伸長有助於辨認需求，但不能把這個位移視為固定管段也會自由發生。","textEn":"Exposed steel changes length with temperature, so supports and joints must permit the motion assumed by the model. Water temperature, solar heating and erection temperature differ, and nonuniform heating can induce bending.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「自由熱伸長」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Free thermal expansion\" is correct?","options":["算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。","暴露鋼管溫度改變會產生自由伸縮，支座與接頭必須提供與模型一致的運動空間。","完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。"],"optionsEn":["Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks.","Exposed steel changes length with temperature, so supports and joints must permit the motion assumed by the model.","The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"暴露鋼管溫度改變會產生自由伸縮，支座與接頭必須提供與模型一致的運動空間。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Exposed steel changes length with temperature, so supports and joints must permit the motion assumed by the model. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b259-v15-14","title":"自由熱伸長：定量估算","titleEn":"Free thermal expansion: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「自由熱伸長」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Free thermal expansion” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設均勻升溫30°C、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C、自由長度100m，ΔL=αLΔT=0.036m；未含溫度梯度與約束。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume uniform warming30°C, expansion coefficient12×10⁻⁶/°C and free length100m. ΔL=0.036m, excluding temperature gradients and restraint. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設均勻升溫30°C、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C、自由長度100m，ΔL=αLΔT=0.036m；未含溫度梯度與約束。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume uniform warming30°C, expansion coefficient12×10⁻⁶/°C and free length100m. ΔL=0.036m, excluding temperature gradients and restraint.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「自由熱伸長」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Free thermal expansion\", which statement holds?","options":["梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。","基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle.","Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b259-v15-15","title":"自由熱伸長：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Free thermal expansion: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「自由熱伸長」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Free thermal expansion” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。將預測位移與接頭行程及滑動支座位置對照，並檢查沿管溫差是否需要分段積分而非使用單一平均溫度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed. Compare predicted displacement with joint travel and sliding-support position, and assess whether varying temperature requires integration along separate pipe segments. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。將預測位移與接頭行程及滑動支座位置對照，並檢查沿管溫差是否需要分段積分而非使用單一平均溫度。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed. Compare predicted displacement with joint travel and sliding-support position, and assess whether varying temperature requires integration along separate pipe segments.","failure":"注意干擾：接頭卡死會把本來的位移需求轉成內力，支座滑到行程端也會改變邊界。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A seized joint converts movement demand into internal force, and a support reaching its travel stop changes the boundary. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。將預測位移與接頭行程及滑動支座位置對照，並檢查沿管溫差是否需要分段積分而非使用單一平均溫度。","textEn":"Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed. Compare predicted displacement with joint travel and sliding-support position, and assess whether varying temperature requires integration along separate pipe segments.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。將預測位移與接頭行程及滑動支座位置對照，並檢查沿管溫差是否需要分段積分而非使用單一平均溫度。","textEn":"Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed. Compare predicted displacement with joint travel and sliding-support position, and assess whether varying temperature requires integration along separate pipe segments.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「自由熱伸長」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Free thermal expansion\"?","options":["以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。"],"optionsEn":["Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以安裝溫度為基準記錄季節溫度範圍，核對自由長度兩端是否真能移動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Reference the seasonal range to erection temperature and verify both ends of the free length can move as assumed. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b259-v15-16","title":"自由熱伸長：失效診斷","titleEn":"Free thermal expansion: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「自由熱伸長」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Free thermal expansion” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"接頭卡死會把本來的位移需求轉成內力，支座滑到行程端也會改變邊界。只用水溫估暴露管線，可能漏掉日照引起的上下壁溫差和彎曲。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A seized joint converts movement demand into internal force, and a support reaching its travel stop changes the boundary. Water temperature alone may miss solar differences between upper and lower pipe walls and associated bending. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設均勻升溫30°C、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C、自由長度100m，ΔL=αLΔT=0.036m；未含溫度梯度與約束。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume uniform warming30°C, expansion coefficient12×10⁻⁶/°C and free length100m. ΔL=0.036m, excluding temperature gradients and restraint.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"接頭卡死會把本來的位移需求轉成內力，支座滑到行程端也會改變邊界。只用水溫估暴露管線，可能漏掉日照引起的上下壁溫差和彎曲。","textEn":"A seized joint converts movement demand into internal force, and a support reaching its travel stop changes the boundary. Water temperature alone may miss solar differences between upper and lower pipe walls and associated bending.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「自由熱伸長」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Free thermal expansion\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","接頭卡死會把本來的位移需求轉成內力，支座滑到行程端也會改變邊界。","完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A seized joint converts movement demand into internal force, and a support reaching its travel stop changes the boundary.","The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"接頭卡死會把本來的位移需求轉成內力，支座滑到行程端也會改變邊界。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A seized joint converts movement demand into internal force, and a support reaching its travel stop changes the boundary. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b259-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「完全約束熱應力」與「管體與充水重量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Fully restrained thermal stress\" and \"Pipe and contained-water weight\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b259-v15-17","title":"完全約束熱應力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Fully restrained thermal stress: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「完全約束熱應力」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fully restrained thermal stress” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"熱伸縮被阻止時會產生軸向內力，其大小取決於管壁、錨塊與地基共同剛度。完全固定只是一個清楚的極端情境，實際支座滑移或混凝土變形會重新分配力；溫度循環還可能形成疲勞，因此不能僅檢查一次最大升溫的平均應力。 假設軸向完全固定、均勻升溫30°C、E=200GPa、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C，壓應力幅值EαΔT=72MPa，限線彈性。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「完全約束熱應力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Prevented thermal movement creates axial force governed by combined pipe, anchor and foundation stiffness. Full restraint is a defined limiting case; sliding and concrete deformation redistribute force in practice. Temperature cycling can also contribute to fatigue, so a single maximum-warming stress does not characterize the complete history or the response of every connection. Assume full axial restraint, uniform warming30°C,E=200GPa andα=12×10⁻⁶/°C. Compressive stress magnitudeEαΔT=72MPa in the linear-elastic idealization. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Fully restrained thermal stress” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「完全約束熱應力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Fully restrained thermal stress”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-17-k1","title":"完全約束熱應力","titleEn":"Fully restrained thermal stress","text":"熱伸縮被阻止時會產生軸向內力，其大小取決於管壁、錨塊與地基共同剛度。完全固定只是一個清楚的極端情境，實際支座滑移或混凝土變形會重新分配力；溫度循環還可能形成疲勞，因此不能僅檢查一次最大升溫的平均應力。","textEn":"Prevented thermal movement creates axial force governed by combined pipe, anchor and foundation stiffness. Full restraint is a defined limiting case; sliding and concrete deformation redistribute force in practice.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「完全約束熱應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fully restrained thermal stress\" is correct?","options":["完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。","管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","熱伸縮被阻止時會產生軸向內力，其大小取決於管壁、錨塊與地基共同剛度。"],"optionsEn":["The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation.","Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","Prevented thermal movement creates axial force governed by combined pipe, anchor and foundation stiffness."],"answer":2,"explanation":"熱伸縮被阻止時會產生軸向內力，其大小取決於管壁、錨塊與地基共同剛度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Prevented thermal movement creates axial force governed by combined pipe, anchor and foundation stiffness. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b259-v15-18","title":"完全約束熱應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Fully restrained thermal stress: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「完全約束熱應力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fully restrained thermal stress” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設軸向完全固定、均勻升溫30°C、E=200GPa、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C，壓應力幅值EαΔT=72MPa，限線彈性。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume full axial restraint, uniform warming30°C,E=200GPa andα=12×10⁻⁶/°C. Compressive stress magnitudeEαΔT=72MPa in the linear-elastic idealization. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設軸向完全固定、均勻升溫30°C、E=200GPa、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C，壓應力幅值EαΔT=72MPa，限線彈性。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume full axial restraint, uniform warming30°C,E=200GPa andα=12×10⁻⁶/°C. Compressive stress magnitudeEαΔT=72MPa in the linear-elastic idealization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「完全約束熱應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fully restrained thermal stress\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。","壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force.","A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b259-v15-19","title":"完全約束熱應力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Fully restrained thermal stress: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「完全約束熱應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fully restrained thermal stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。核對升溫造成壓縮、降溫造成拉伸的符號，再與壓力軸力及支承變形組合，保留各荷載的時間關係。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases. Check warming-compression and cooling-tension signs, then combine pressure force and support deformation while retaining the timing of each load contribution. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。核對升溫造成壓縮、降溫造成拉伸的符號，再與壓力軸力及支承變形組合，保留各荷載的時間關係。","observationEn":"Site practice: State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases. Check warming-compression and cooling-tension signs, then combine pressure force and support deformation while retaining the timing of each load contribution.","failure":"注意干擾：忽略錨塊位移可能高估平均熱力，但忽略局部卡阻又可能低估局部需求。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring anchor movement can overstate average thermal force, while missing local seizure understates local demand. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。核對升溫造成壓縮、降溫造成拉伸的符號，再與壓力軸力及支承變形組合，保留各荷載的時間關係。","textEn":"State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases. Check warming-compression and cooling-tension signs, then combine pressure force and support deformation while retaining the timing of each load contribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。核對升溫造成壓縮、降溫造成拉伸的符號，再與壓力軸力及支承變形組合，保留各荷載的時間關係。","textEn":"State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases. Check warming-compression and cooling-tension signs, then combine pressure force and support deformation while retaining the timing of each load contribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「完全約束熱應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fully restrained thermal stress\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。","封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases.","The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先說明固定是位移約束還是高剛度彈簧，分開計算完全自由與固定兩端情境。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"State whether restraint is a prescribed displacement or a stiff spring and compare free and fixed limiting cases. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b259-v15-20","title":"完全約束熱應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fully restrained thermal stress: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「完全約束熱應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fully restrained thermal stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"忽略錨塊位移可能高估平均熱力，但忽略局部卡阻又可能低估局部需求。若進入降伏或接頭滑移，線性完全固定公式便不能描述卸載後的殘餘變形。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring anchor movement can overstate average thermal force, while missing local seizure understates local demand. Yielding or joint slip invalidates the linear fully restrained model for residual deformation after unloading. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設軸向完全固定、均勻升溫30°C、E=200GPa、α=12×10⁻⁶/°C，壓應力幅值EαΔT=72MPa，限線彈性。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Compressive stress magnitudeEαΔT=72MPa in the linear-elastic idealization.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"忽略錨塊位移可能高估平均熱力，但忽略局部卡阻又可能低估局部需求。若進入降伏或接頭滑移，線性完全固定公式便不能描述卸載後的殘餘變形。","textEn":"Ignoring anchor movement can overstate average thermal force, while missing local seizure understates local demand. Yielding or joint slip invalidates the linear fully restrained model for residual deformation after unloading.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「完全約束熱應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fully restrained thermal stress\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","忽略錨塊位移可能高估平均熱力，但忽略局部卡阻又可能低估局部需求。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","Ignoring anchor movement can overstate average thermal force, while missing local seizure understates local demand."],"answer":2,"explanation":"忽略錨塊位移可能高估平均熱力，但忽略局部卡阻又可能低估局部需求。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring anchor movement can overstate average thermal force, while missing local seizure understates local demand. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b259-v15-21","title":"管體與充水重量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pipe and contained-water weight: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「管體與充水重量」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pipe and contained-water weight” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"支承承受的不只有鋼殼重量，充水狀態通常還有大量水重，空管與滿管因而是不同荷載情境。斜管重量要分解到管軸與法向，包覆混凝土或外部浮力也需要獨立列項；不能把管內水的體積當成鋼材體積或忽略單位長度的定義。 假設水平滿管內徑2m、外徑2.04m、鋼密度7850及水1000kg/m³，w=g[7850π(2.04²−2²)/4+1000π]=40.593kN/m。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「管體與充水重量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Supports carry both steel and contained water, making empty and full conditions distinct load cases. Inclined weight must be resolved axially and normally, while encasement or external buoyancy requires separate terms. Internal water volume is not steel volume, and the reference unit length must remain explicit before reactions are distributed between supports. Assume a horizontal full pipe with inner diameter2m, outer2.04m, steel density7850 and water1000kg/m³. Combined distributed weight is40.593kN/m. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pipe and contained-water weight” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「管體與充水重量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pipe and contained-water weight”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-21-k1","title":"管體與充水重量","titleEn":"Pipe and contained-water weight","text":"支承承受的不只有鋼殼重量，充水狀態通常還有大量水重，空管與滿管因而是不同荷載情境。斜管重量要分解到管軸與法向，包覆混凝土或外部浮力也需要獨立列項；不能把管內水的體積當成鋼材體積或忽略單位長度的定義。","textEn":"Supports carry both steel and contained water, making empty and full conditions distinct load cases. Inclined weight must be resolved axially and normally, while encasement or external buoyancy requires separate terms.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「管體與充水重量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pipe and contained-water weight\" is correct?","options":["支承承受的不只有鋼殼重量，充水狀態通常還有大量水重，空管與滿管因而是不同荷載情境。","管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Supports carry both steel and contained water, making empty and full conditions distinct load cases.","Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"支承承受的不只有鋼殼重量，充水狀態通常還有大量水重，空管與滿管因而是不同荷載情境。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Supports carry both steel and contained water, making empty and full conditions distinct load cases. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b259-v15-22","title":"管體與充水重量：定量估算","titleEn":"Pipe and contained-water weight: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「管體與充水重量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pipe and contained-water weight” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設水平滿管內徑2m、外徑2.04m、鋼密度7850及水1000kg/m³，w=g[7850π(2.04²−2²)/4+1000π]=40.593kN/m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a horizontal full pipe with inner diameter2m, outer2.04m, steel density7850 and water1000kg/m³. Combined distributed weight is40.593kN/m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設水平滿管內徑2m、外徑2.04m、鋼密度7850及水1000kg/m³，w=g[7850π(2.04²−2²)/4+1000π]=40.593kN/m。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a horizontal full pipe with inner diameter2m, outer2.04m, steel density7850 and water1000kg/m³. Combined distributed weight is40.593kN/m.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「管體與充水重量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pipe and contained-water weight\", which statement holds?","options":["基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。"],"optionsEn":["Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b259-v15-23","title":"管體與充水重量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pipe and contained-water weight: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「管體與充水重量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pipe and contained-water weight” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。比較空管和滿管，再按斜率分解重量，將外部水壓或混凝土支承另列清楚。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load. Check squared diameters, compare empty and full cases, resolve inclined weight and separately identify external pressure and any concrete support contribution. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。比較空管和滿管，再按斜率分解重量，將外部水壓或混凝土支承另列清楚。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load. Check squared diameters, compare empty and full cases, resolve inclined weight and separately identify external pressure and any concrete support contribution.","failure":"注意干擾：漏算水重會低估反力，將壁厚直接當成截面面積則量綱已錯。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Omitting water understates reactions, while using thickness as area is dimensionally wrong. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。比較空管和滿管，再按斜率分解重量，將外部水壓或混凝土支承另列清楚。","textEn":"Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load. Check squared diameters, compare empty and full cases, resolve inclined weight and separately identify external pressure and any concrete support contribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。比較空管和滿管，再按斜率分解重量，將外部水壓或混凝土支承另列清楚。","textEn":"Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load. Check squared diameters, compare empty and full cases, resolve inclined weight and separately identify external pressure and any concrete support contribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「管體與充水重量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pipe and contained-water weight\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。","分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.","Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load."],"answer":2,"explanation":"分別畫鋼環與水圓截面，以密度乘面積再乘重力計單位長度荷載，核對外徑減內徑的平方順序。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw steel annulus and water disk separately, multiplying density by area and gravity for each unit-length load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b259-v15-24","title":"管體與充水重量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pipe and contained-water weight: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「管體與充水重量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pipe and contained-water weight” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"漏算水重會低估反力，將壁厚直接當成截面面積則量綱已錯。外部地下水作用於空管時可能有淨上浮，與滿管向下重量情境不能混為同一驗算。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Omitting water understates reactions, while using thickness as area is dimensionally wrong. Groundwater can produce net uplift on an empty conduit, which must not be conflated with the downward weight of the full-pipe case. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設水平滿管內徑2m、外徑2.04m、鋼密度7850及水1000kg/m³，w=g[7850π(2.04²−2²)/4+1000π]=40.593kN/m。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Combined distributed weight is40.593kN/m.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"漏算水重會低估反力，將壁厚直接當成截面面積則量綱已錯。外部地下水作用於空管時可能有淨上浮，與滿管向下重量情境不能混為同一驗算。","textEn":"Omitting water understates reactions, while using thickness as area is dimensionally wrong. Groundwater can produce net uplift on an empty conduit, which must not be conflated with the downward weight of the full-pipe case.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「管體與充水重量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pipe and contained-water weight\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["漏算水重會低估反力，將壁厚直接當成截面面積則量綱已錯。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Omitting water understates reactions, while using thickness as area is dimensionally wrong.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"漏算水重會低估反力，將壁厚直接當成截面面積則量綱已錯。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Omitting water understates reactions, while using thickness as area is dimensionally wrong. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b259-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「跨距與梁式反力」與「滑動摩擦與固定點」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Span and beam reactions\" and \"Sliding friction and fixed points\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b259-v15-25","title":"跨距與梁式反力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Span and beam reactions: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「跨距與梁式反力」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Span and beam reactions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"相鄰支座之間的管段可先用梁模型理解整體彎矩與反力，但鞍座附近的環向彎曲和殼體橢圓化不是梁公式能描述。連續支承、不同沉陷與壓力剛化也可能改變分配，因此必須把全跨分析與局部殼體查核分開，同時保持一致荷載路徑。 假設簡支跨距10m、均布荷載40kN/m，Mmax=wL²/8=500kNm，兩端反力各200kN；未評估鞍座局部殼應力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「跨距與梁式反力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A beam idealization helps interpret span moment and reactions, but it does not resolve circumferential bending and shell ovality near saddles. Continuity, differential settlement and pressure effects can change load distribution. Separate global span response from local shell assessment while keeping a consistent load path between the two analytical representations. Assume a simply supported10m span under uniform40kN/m. Maximum moment500kNm and reactions200kN each exclude local saddle shell stresses. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Span and beam reactions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「跨距與梁式反力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Span and beam reactions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-25-k1","title":"跨距與梁式反力","titleEn":"Span and beam reactions","text":"相鄰支座之間的管段可先用梁模型理解整體彎矩與反力，但鞍座附近的環向彎曲和殼體橢圓化不是梁公式能描述。連續支承、不同沉陷與壓力剛化也可能改變分配，因此必須把全跨分析與局部殼體查核分開，同時保持一致荷載路徑。","textEn":"A beam idealization helps interpret span moment and reactions, but it does not resolve circumferential bending and shell ovality near saddles. Continuity, differential settlement and pressure effects can change load distribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「跨距與梁式反力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Span and beam reactions\" is correct?","options":["梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。","相鄰支座之間的管段可先用梁模型理解整體彎矩與反力，但鞍座附近的環向彎曲和殼體橢圓化不是梁公式能描述。","靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。"],"optionsEn":["A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle.","A beam idealization helps interpret span moment and reactions, but it does not resolve circumferential bending and shell ovality near saddles.","Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force."],"answer":1,"explanation":"相鄰支座之間的管段可先用梁模型理解整體彎矩與反力，但鞍座附近的環向彎曲和殼體橢圓化不是梁公式能描述。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A beam idealization helps interpret span moment and reactions, but it does not resolve circumferential bending and shell ovality near saddles. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b259-v15-26","title":"跨距與梁式反力：定量估算","titleEn":"Span and beam reactions: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨距與梁式反力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Span and beam reactions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設簡支跨距10m、均布荷載40kN/m，Mmax=wL²/8=500kNm，兩端反力各200kN；未評估鞍座局部殼應力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a simply supported10m span under uniform40kN/m. Maximum moment500kNm and reactions200kN each exclude local saddle shell stresses. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設簡支跨距10m、均布荷載40kN/m，Mmax=wL²/8=500kNm，兩端反力各200kN；未評估鞍座局部殼應力。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a simply supported10m span under uniform40kN/m. Maximum moment500kNm and reactions200kN each exclude local saddle shell stresses.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「跨距與梁式反力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Span and beam reactions\", which statement holds?","options":["壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。","封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects.","The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b259-v15-27","title":"跨距與梁式反力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Span and beam reactions: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨距與梁式反力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Span and beam reactions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。把全跨彎矩傳入管壁應力分析，並另設鞍座接觸角、加勁環及局部變形檢核項目。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases. Carry span moment into wall analysis while separately assessing saddle contact angle, stiffening rings and local shell distortion. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。把全跨彎矩傳入管壁應力分析，並另設鞍座接觸角、加勁環及局部變形檢核項目。","observationEn":"Site practice: Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases. Carry span moment into wall analysis while separately assessing saddle contact angle, stiffening rings and local shell distortion.","failure":"注意干擾：簡支假設若不符合實際固定程度會改變彎矩位置，單看跨中最大值也可能漏掉支座負彎矩。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An incorrect simple-support assumption shifts moment distribution, and focusing on midspan misses support moments. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。把全跨彎矩傳入管壁應力分析，並另設鞍座接觸角、加勁環及局部變形檢核項目。","textEn":"Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases. Carry span moment into wall analysis while separately assessing saddle contact angle, stiffening rings and local shell distortion.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。把全跨彎矩傳入管壁應力分析，並另設鞍座接觸角、加勁環及局部變形檢核項目。","textEn":"Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases. Carry span moment into wall analysis while separately assessing saddle contact angle, stiffening rings and local shell distortion.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「跨距與梁式反力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Span and beam reactions\"?","options":["畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。"],"optionsEn":["Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫清支座轉動及平移自由度，以反力總和檢查荷載平衡，再比較連續梁或支座沉陷情境。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Define support rotational and translational freedoms and check reaction sum against total load, then compare continuity and settlement cases. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b259-v15-28","title":"跨距與梁式反力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Span and beam reactions: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨距與梁式反力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Span and beam reactions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"簡支假設若不符合實際固定程度會改變彎矩位置，單看跨中最大值也可能漏掉支座負彎矩。管殼局部壓扁即使總體梁應力不高，仍可能控制支承細節。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An incorrect simple-support assumption shifts moment distribution, and focusing on midspan misses support moments. Local flattening of the shell can govern saddle details even when the global beam stress appears modest. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設簡支跨距10m、均布荷載40kN/m，Mmax=wL²/8=500kNm，兩端反力各200kN；未評估鞍座局部殼應力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Maximum moment500kNm and reactions200kN each exclude local saddle shell stresses.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"簡支假設若不符合實際固定程度會改變彎矩位置，單看跨中最大值也可能漏掉支座負彎矩。管殼局部壓扁即使總體梁應力不高，仍可能控制支承細節。","textEn":"An incorrect simple-support assumption shifts moment distribution, and focusing on midspan misses support moments. Local flattening of the shell can govern saddle details even when the global beam stress appears modest.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「跨距與梁式反力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Span and beam reactions\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","簡支假設若不符合實際固定程度會改變彎矩位置，單看跨中最大值也可能漏掉支座負彎矩。","靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","An incorrect simple-support assumption shifts moment distribution, and focusing on midspan misses support moments.","Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force."],"answer":1,"explanation":"簡支假設若不符合實際固定程度會改變彎矩位置，單看跨中最大值也可能漏掉支座負彎矩。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An incorrect simple-support assumption shifts moment distribution, and focusing on midspan misses support moments. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b259-v15-29","title":"滑動摩擦與固定點：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sliding friction and fixed points: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「滑動摩擦與固定點」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sliding friction and fixed points” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"滑動支座的目的通常是容許伸縮，但摩擦仍會把部分軸力傳到固定點。靜摩擦上限與實際動摩擦力不同，接觸壓力、鏽蝕及潤滑會改變參數；不能用名義摩擦係數保證永遠能滑動，也不能把所有支座最大摩擦同時同向當成必然情況。 假設接觸法向力400kN、庫侖摩擦係數0.15，摩擦上限μN=60kN；靜止時實際摩擦可小於此值。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「滑動摩擦與固定點」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Sliding supports permit movement while friction still transfers axial force to fixed points. Limiting static friction differs from actual sliding resistance, and contact pressure, corrosion and lubrication change the parameter. A nominal coefficient does not guarantee motion, nor does it establish that every support simultaneously mobilizes its maximum resistance in the same direction. Assume contact normal force400kN and Coulomb coefficient0.15. Limiting frictionμN=60kN; actual static friction may be smaller than this bound. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sliding friction and fixed points” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「滑動摩擦與固定點」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sliding friction and fixed points”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-29-k1","title":"滑動摩擦與固定點","titleEn":"Sliding friction and fixed points","text":"滑動支座的目的通常是容許伸縮，但摩擦仍會把部分軸力傳到固定點。靜摩擦上限與實際動摩擦力不同，接觸壓力、鏽蝕及潤滑會改變參數；不能用名義摩擦係數保證永遠能滑動，也不能把所有支座最大摩擦同時同向當成必然情況。","textEn":"Sliding supports permit movement while friction still transfers axial force to fixed points. Limiting static friction differs from actual sliding resistance, and contact pressure, corrosion and lubrication change the parameter.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「滑動摩擦與固定點」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sliding friction and fixed points\" is correct?","options":["靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。","基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。","滑動支座的目的通常是容許伸縮，但摩擦仍會把部分軸力傳到固定點。"],"optionsEn":["Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force.","Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.","Sliding supports permit movement while friction still transfers axial force to fixed points."],"answer":2,"explanation":"滑動支座的目的通常是容許伸縮，但摩擦仍會把部分軸力傳到固定點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Sliding supports permit movement while friction still transfers axial force to fixed points. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b259-v15-30","title":"滑動摩擦與固定點：定量估算","titleEn":"Sliding friction and fixed points: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「滑動摩擦與固定點」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sliding friction and fixed points” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設接觸法向力400kN、庫侖摩擦係數0.15，摩擦上限μN=60kN；靜止時實際摩擦可小於此值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume contact normal force400kN and Coulomb coefficient0.15. Limiting frictionμN=60kN; actual static friction may be smaller than this bound. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設接觸法向力400kN、庫侖摩擦係數0.15，摩擦上限μN=60kN；靜止時實際摩擦可小於此值。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume contact normal force400kN and Coulomb coefficient0.15. Limiting frictionμN=60kN; actual static friction may be smaller than this bound.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「滑動摩擦與固定點」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sliding friction and fixed points\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設，非操作設定。","平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。","彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable.","Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b259-v15-31","title":"滑動摩擦與固定點：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sliding friction and fixed points: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「滑動摩擦與固定點」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sliding friction and fixed points” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。用摩擦上下界做反力敏感度，逐段檢查軸向平衡，不把極限值當成每個時刻都存在的固定外力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load. Explore plausible friction bounds in reaction sensitivity and check axial equilibrium segment by segment rather than treating the limit as a constant force acting at all times. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。用摩擦上下界做反力敏感度，逐段檢查軸向平衡，不把極限值當成每個時刻都存在的固定外力。","observationEn":"Site practice: Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load. Explore plausible friction bounds in reaction sensitivity and check axial equilibrium segment by segment rather than treating the limit as a constant force acting at all times.","failure":"注意干擾：支座鏽死時原先的滑動邊界可能變成固定點，熱力路徑隨之改變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A corroded seized support may become a fixed point and redirect thermal force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。用摩擦上下界做反力敏感度，逐段檢查軸向平衡，不把極限值當成每個時刻都存在的固定外力。","textEn":"Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load. Explore plausible friction bounds in reaction sensitivity and check axial equilibrium segment by segment rather than treating the limit as a constant force acting at all times.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。用摩擦上下界做反力敏感度，逐段檢查軸向平衡，不把極限值當成每個時刻都存在的固定外力。","textEn":"Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load. Explore plausible friction bounds in reaction sensitivity and check axial equilibrium segment by segment rather than treating the limit as a constant force acting at all times.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「滑動摩擦與固定點」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sliding friction and fixed points\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。","完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load.","The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先判斷支座處於黏著還是滑動狀態，對照位移紀錄、接觸面狀況與法向荷載。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Determine sticking or sliding from movement records, contact condition and normal load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b259-v15-32","title":"滑動摩擦與固定點：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sliding friction and fixed points: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「滑動摩擦與固定點」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sliding friction and fixed points” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"支座鏽死時原先的滑動邊界可能變成固定點，熱力路徑隨之改變。摩擦方向也會在升降溫時反轉，忽略歷時便可能錯算錨塊反力及接頭行程。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A corroded seized support may become a fixed point and redirect thermal force. Friction reverses with movement direction, so neglecting the sequence can misstate anchor reaction and expansion-joint travel during temperature cycles. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設接觸法向力400kN、庫侖摩擦係數0.15，摩擦上限μN=60kN；靜止時實際摩擦可小於此值。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Limiting frictionμN=60kN; actual static friction may be smaller than this bound.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「靜止滑動支座的實際摩擦力在任何時刻都必定等於摩擦係數乘法向力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Actual friction at a stationary sliding support always equals coefficient times normal force.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"支座鏽死時原先的滑動邊界可能變成固定點，熱力路徑隨之改變。摩擦方向也會在升降溫時反轉，忽略歷時便可能錯算錨塊反力及接頭行程。","textEn":"A corroded seized support may become a fixed point and redirect thermal force. Friction reverses with movement direction, so neglecting the sequence can misstate anchor reaction and expansion-joint travel during temperature cycles.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「滑動摩擦與固定點」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sliding friction and fixed points\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。","支座鏽死時原先的滑動邊界可能變成固定點，熱力路徑隨之改變。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.","A corroded seized support may become a fixed point and redirect thermal force."],"answer":2,"explanation":"支座鏽死時原先的滑動邊界可能變成固定點，熱力路徑隨之改變。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A corroded seized support may become a fixed point and redirect thermal force. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b259-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「錨塊基底平均壓力」與「減薄與剩餘厚度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Anchor base average pressure\" and \"Wall loss and remaining thickness\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b259-v15-33","title":"錨塊基底平均壓力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Anchor base average pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「錨塊基底平均壓力」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Anchor base average pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"錨塊把管線荷載傳到地基，但平均基底壓力只適用於假設的接觸狀態，不能單獨評估抗滑或抗傾覆。偏心、基底張開及地基不均勻會改變壓力分布；應把力、力矩、排水及基礎剛度放在同一自由體中，再決定簡化均壓是否合理。 假設中心向下合力2MN作用於全接觸基底4m²，q=N/A=500kPa；不是地基允許承壓值且未計偏心。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「錨塊基底平均壓力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An anchor transfers pipeline loads to the foundation, but average base pressure depends on the assumed contact state and does not establish sliding or overturning resistance. Eccentricity, uplifted contact and variable ground stiffness change the distribution. Include force, moment, drainage and foundation stiffness before deciding whether a uniform-pressure idealization is defensible. Assume a centered downward resultant2MN on a fully contacting4m² base. Averageq=500kPa is not allowable bearing pressure and excludes eccentricity. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Anchor base average pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「錨塊基底平均壓力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Anchor base average pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-33-k1","title":"錨塊基底平均壓力","titleEn":"Anchor base average pressure","text":"錨塊把管線荷載傳到地基，但平均基底壓力只適用於假設的接觸狀態，不能單獨評估抗滑或抗傾覆。偏心、基底張開及地基不均勻會改變壓力分布；應把力、力矩、排水及基礎剛度放在同一自由體中，再決定簡化均壓是否合理。","textEn":"An anchor transfers pipeline loads to the foundation, but average base pressure depends on the assumed contact state and does not establish sliding or overturning resistance. Eccentricity, uplifted contact and variable ground stiffness change the distribution.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「錨塊基底平均壓力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Anchor base average pressure\" is correct?","options":["錨塊把管線荷載傳到地基，但平均基底壓力只適用於假設的接觸狀態，不能單獨評估抗滑或抗傾覆。","基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。","壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。"],"optionsEn":["An anchor transfers pipeline loads to the foundation, but average base pressure depends on the assumed contact state and does not establish sliding or overturning resistance.","Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.","A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects."],"answer":0,"explanation":"錨塊把管線荷載傳到地基，但平均基底壓力只適用於假設的接觸狀態，不能單獨評估抗滑或抗傾覆。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An anchor transfers pipeline loads to the foundation, but average base pressure depends on the assumed contact state and does not establish sliding or overturning resistance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b259-v15-34","title":"錨塊基底平均壓力：定量估算","titleEn":"Anchor base average pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「錨塊基底平均壓力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Anchor base average pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設中心向下合力2MN作用於全接觸基底4m²，q=N/A=500kPa；不是地基允許承壓值且未計偏心。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a centered downward resultant2MN on a fully contacting4m² base. Averageq=500kPa is not allowable bearing pressure and excludes eccentricity. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設中心向下合力2MN作用於全接觸基底4m²，q=N/A=500kPa；不是地基允許承壓值且未計偏心。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume a centered downward resultant2MN on a fully contacting4m² base. Averageq=500kPa is not allowable bearing pressure and excludes eccentricity.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「錨塊基底平均壓力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Anchor base average pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["封閉端公式可直接代表任何固定、埋設或帶伸縮接頭管線的軸向應力。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。","算出自由伸長後就可假定任何固定錨塊之間都會發生同樣位移。"],"optionsEn":["The closed-end formula directly gives axial stress for every fixed, buried or expansion-jointed pipeline.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","Calculated free expansion occurs unchanged between any pair of fixed anchor blocks."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b259-v15-35","title":"錨塊基底平均壓力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Anchor base average pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「錨塊基底平均壓力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Anchor base average pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。用接觸範圍和地基資料判斷均壓假設，再分別查抗滑、傾覆、沉陷與混凝土局部受力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust. Use contact and ground evidence to assess uniform pressure, then examine sliding, overturning, settlement and local concrete actions as separate mechanisms. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。用接觸範圍和地基資料判斷均壓假設，再分別查抗滑、傾覆、沉陷與混凝土局部受力。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust. Use contact and ground evidence to assess uniform pressure, then examine sliding, overturning, settlement and local concrete actions as separate mechanisms.","failure":"注意干擾：將五百千帕誤寫成地基承載能力會倒置需求與抗力，偏心時平均值又會掩蓋最大壓力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Calling500kPa a foundation capacity reverses demand and resistance, while average pressure hides peaks under eccentricity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。用接觸範圍和地基資料判斷均壓假設，再分別查抗滑、傾覆、沉陷與混凝土局部受力。","textEn":"Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust. Use contact and ground evidence to assess uniform pressure, then examine sliding, overturning, settlement and local concrete actions as separate mechanisms.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。用接觸範圍和地基資料判斷均壓假設，再分別查抗滑、傾覆、沉陷與混凝土局部受力。","textEn":"Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust. Use contact and ground evidence to assess uniform pressure, then examine sliding, overturning, settlement and local concrete actions as separate mechanisms.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「錨塊基底平均壓力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Anchor base average pressure\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","管線支座只需要承受鋼材自重而不必考慮管內水重。","對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Penstock supports carry only the steel’s own weight and need not consider contained water.","Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對錨塊整體列垂直力與力矩平衡，核對是否有地下水上浮或水平管推力造成偏心。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check vertical-force and moment equilibrium, including groundwater uplift and eccentricity from horizontal pipe thrust. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b259-v15-36","title":"錨塊基底平均壓力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Anchor base average pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「錨塊基底平均壓力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Anchor base average pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將五百千帕誤寫成地基承載能力會倒置需求與抗力，偏心時平均值又會掩蓋最大壓力。基底部分脫離後，仍以原面積均分會低估剩餘接觸區需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Calling500kPa a foundation capacity reverses demand and resistance, while average pressure hides peaks under eccentricity. After partial loss of contact, dividing by the original area understates demand on the remaining bearing region. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設中心向下合力2MN作用於全接觸基底4m²，q=N/A=500kPa；不是地基允許承壓值且未計偏心。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Averageq=500kPa is not allowable bearing pressure and excludes eccentricity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「基底平均壓力算得出來就代表錨塊抗滑、傾覆與地基承載均已合格。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Calculating average base pressure proves acceptable sliding, overturning and foundation capacity.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將五百千帕誤寫成地基承載能力會倒置需求與抗力，偏心時平均值又會掩蓋最大壓力。基底部分脫離後，仍以原面積均分會低估剩餘接觸區需求。","textEn":"Calling500kPa a foundation capacity reverses demand and resistance, while average pressure hides peaks under eccentricity. After partial loss of contact, dividing by the original area understates demand on the remaining bearing region.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「錨塊基底平均壓力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Anchor base average pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["將五百千帕誤寫成地基承載能力會倒置需求與抗力，偏心時平均值又會掩蓋最大壓力。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。"],"optionsEn":["Calling500kPa a foundation capacity reverses demand and resistance, while average pressure hides peaks under eccentricity.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將五百千帕誤寫成地基承載能力會倒置需求與抗力，偏心時平均值又會掩蓋最大壓力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Calling500kPa a foundation capacity reverses demand and resistance, while average pressure hides peaks under eccentricity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b259-v15-37","title":"減薄與剩餘厚度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Wall loss and remaining thickness: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「減薄與剩餘厚度」如何影響壓力鋼管錨定與支承的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Wall loss and remaining thickness” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Penstock anchorage and supports”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"腐蝕造成的壁厚減少會提高相同內壓下的膜應力，但均勻減薄只是一種理想情境，局部坑蝕與裂縫需要不同評估。厚度量測的網格與位置應可追溯，不能用最容易量到的一點代表整段；塗層良好也不等於內外壁都沒有缺陷。 假設壓力及直徑不變、均勻厚度20mm降至18mm，環向應力100×20/18=111.11MPa，增加11.11%；未評局部坑蝕。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「減薄與剩餘厚度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Wall loss raises membrane stress at the same internal pressure, but uniform thinning is only one idealization and pits or cracks require different assessment. Measurement grids and locations must be traceable; an easily accessible point cannot represent the whole segment. A sound coating also does not prove the absence of defects on either surface. Assume unchanged pressure and diameter with uniform thickness falling20 to18mm. Hoop stress rises100×20/18=111.11MPa, an11.11% increase, excluding pitting assessment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Wall loss and remaining thickness” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設，非操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「減薄與剩餘厚度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Wall loss and remaining thickness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-37-k1","title":"減薄與剩餘厚度","titleEn":"Wall loss and remaining thickness","text":"腐蝕造成的壁厚減少會提高相同內壓下的膜應力，但均勻減薄只是一種理想情境，局部坑蝕與裂縫需要不同評估。厚度量測的網格與位置應可追溯，不能用最容易量到的一點代表整段；塗層良好也不等於內外壁都沒有缺陷。","textEn":"Wall loss raises membrane stress at the same internal pressure, but uniform thinning is only one idealization and pits or cracks require different assessment. Measurement grids and locations must be traceable; an easily accessible point cannot represent the whole segment.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「減薄與剩餘厚度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wall loss and remaining thickness\" is correct?","options":["壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。","腐蝕造成的壁厚減少會提高相同內壓下的膜應力，但均勻減薄只是一種理想情境，局部坑蝕與裂縫需要不同評估。","平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。"],"optionsEn":["A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects.","Wall loss raises membrane stress at the same internal pressure, but uniform thinning is only one idealization and pits or cracks require different assessment.","A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"腐蝕造成的壁厚減少會提高相同內壓下的膜應力，但均勻減薄只是一種理想情境，局部坑蝕與裂縫需要不同評估。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Wall loss raises membrane stress at the same internal pressure, but uniform thinning is only one idealization and pits or cracks require different assessment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b259-v15-38","title":"減薄與剩餘厚度：定量估算","titleEn":"Wall loss and remaining thickness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「減薄與剩餘厚度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Wall loss and remaining thickness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設壓力及直徑不變、均勻厚度20mm降至18mm，環向應力100×20/18=111.11MPa，增加11.11%；未評局部坑蝕。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume unchanged pressure and diameter with uniform thickness falling20 to18mm. Hoop stress rises100×20/18=111.11MPa, an11.11% increase, excluding pitting assessment. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。假設壓力及直徑不變、均勻厚度20mm降至18mm，環向應力100×20/18=111.11MPa，增加11.11%；未評局部坑蝕。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Assume unchanged pressure and diameter with uniform thickness falling20 to18mm. Hoop stress rises100×20/18=111.11MPa, an11.11% increase, excluding pitting assessment.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「減薄與剩餘厚度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wall loss and remaining thickness\", which statement holds?","options":["彎管的錨定合力永遠等於一端壓力乘截面積而與轉角無關。","完全固定熱應力公式能直接描述任何降伏、滑移與殘餘變形。","原創教學假設，非操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Elbow anchorage force always equals one end pressure times area, regardless of the turn angle.","The fully restrained elastic formula directly describes yielding, sliding and all residual deformation.","Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設，非操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions, not operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b259-v15-39","title":"減薄與剩餘厚度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Wall loss and remaining thickness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「減薄與剩餘厚度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Wall loss and remaining thickness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。分辨均勻減薄、局部坑蝕和裂紋，再用相應方法評估，不以平均厚度或外觀照片取代最弱區域的證據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections. Distinguish uniform loss, pits and cracks and apply appropriate assessment methods rather than substituting average thickness or appearance for evidence at the weakest region. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。分辨均勻減薄、局部坑蝕和裂紋，再用相應方法評估，不以平均厚度或外觀照片取代最弱區域的證據。","observationEn":"Site practice: Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections. Distinguish uniform loss, pits and cracks and apply appropriate assessment methods rather than substituting average thickness or appearance for evidence at the weakest region.","failure":"注意干擾：量測點偏離最薄區會得到假安心，腐蝕速率也未必長期固定。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Measurements missing the thinnest area give false reassurance, and corrosion rate need not remain constant. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。分辨均勻減薄、局部坑蝕和裂紋，再用相應方法評估，不以平均厚度或外觀照片取代最弱區域的證據。","textEn":"Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections. Distinguish uniform loss, pits and cracks and apply appropriate assessment methods rather than substituting average thickness or appearance for evidence at the weakest region.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。分辨均勻減薄、局部坑蝕和裂紋，再用相應方法評估，不以平均厚度或外觀照片取代最弱區域的證據。","textEn":"Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections. Distinguish uniform loss, pits and cracks and apply appropriate assessment methods rather than substituting average thickness or appearance for evidence at the weakest region.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「減薄與剩餘厚度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wall loss and remaining thickness\"?","options":["將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","梁式跨中彎矩通過檢查就等於鞍座周圍殼體應力也已驗證。"],"optionsEn":["Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A satisfactory beam midspan moment automatically verifies shell stresses around every saddle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"將厚度圖與原始製造、焊縫和歷次量測對位，確認儀器校正與塗層修正。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Register thickness maps with fabrication, weld and prior inspection records, checking calibration and coating corrections. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b259-v15-40","title":"減薄與剩餘厚度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wall loss and remaining thickness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"prerequisiteIds":["b259-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「減薄與剩餘厚度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wall loss and remaining thickness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"量測點偏離最薄區會得到假安心，腐蝕速率也未必長期固定。單靠線性外推厚度可能漏掉局部加速或裂紋擴展，應保留測值不確定度與機制分類。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Measurements missing the thinnest area give false reassurance, and corrosion rate need not remain constant. Linear thickness extrapolation can miss local acceleration or crack growth, requiring retained uncertainty and a clear classification of damage mechanisms. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設壓力及直徑不變、均勻厚度20mm降至18mm，環向應力100×20/18=111.11MPa，增加11.11%；未評局部坑蝕。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Hoop stress rises100×20/18=111.11MPa, an11.11% increase, excluding pitting assessment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「壁厚減少百分之十時膜應力一定也只增加百分之十且不需檢查局部缺陷。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A ten-percent thickness loss raises stress by exactly ten percent and removes any need to check local defects.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b259-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"量測點偏離最薄區會得到假安心，腐蝕速率也未必長期固定。單靠線性外推厚度可能漏掉局部加速或裂紋擴展，應保留測值不確定度與機制分類。","textEn":"Measurements missing the thinnest area give false reassurance, and corrosion rate need not remain constant. Linear thickness extrapolation can miss local acceleration or crack growth, requiring retained uncertainty and a clear classification of damage mechanisms.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]},{"id":"b259-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「減薄與剩餘厚度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wall loss and remaining thickness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","量測點偏離最薄區會得到假安心，腐蝕速率也未必長期固定。","平均環向應力低於某個數字就能證明所有支座與焊縫都安全。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Measurements missing the thinnest area give false reassurance, and corrosion rate need not remain constant.","A low average hoop stress proves every support and weld is structurally acceptable."],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測點偏離最薄區會得到假安心，腐蝕速率也未必長期固定。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Measurements missing the thinnest area give false reassurance, and corrosion rate need not remain constant. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-penstock-inspection","v6-hoover-history","v15s-eklutna-history","v15s-hydro-structures"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
